    4 E^(Complex[0, 3] $CellContext`Phi) (-1 + Complex[0, 2] $CellContext`En + 
      4 $CellContext`En^2) + 
    2 E^(Complex[0, 2] $CellContext`Phi) (5 - 4 $CellContext`En^2 + 
      32 $CellContext`En^4))],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9805304919467025`*^9, 3.980530612227928*^9, 
  3.980532524427393*^9, 3.9805350217817707`*^9, 3.9806645898002253`*^9, 
